# Build outputs.
_novo/

# The generated API page.  `novo doc` writes it here; the registry gets
# its own copy, uploaded beside the archive by `novo pkg publish`.
APIDOC.md

# The image tool `novo pkg build` writes, named after the package.
novofs-tools

# Volume images a test or a run of the tool writes.
*.img
*.bin

# NOT novo.lock: a locked build resolves the same closure twice, and a
# consumer never reads a dependency's lock.
